ntegrates with any existing Dometic SeaStar rack or rotary cable steering system, so there is no need to install \nnew steering to take advantage of this new technology. \n• Designed as a self-contained, plug-and-play system which easily mounts to all major outboard \nbrands and integrates with the boat’s existing mechanical steering in less than 30 minutes. \n• Built in Fail-safe System automatically reverts to mechanical steering in the event of a system failure. \nManufacturer Model Dimension \n“X” \nin \nSuzuki DF70A, DF80A, DF90A, DF100A, DF115A, DF140A, DF150A, DF175A, DF200A 10.2 \nYamaha F75C, F100B, F115A, F75B, F80B, F90B, F100D, F75F, F90C/D, F100F/G, F115B, F130A,F150A/B, F150C/D/F, F165A, F175A/B, F185A, F200F/G 10.2 \n10.0 \nHonda BF75, BF90, BF100, BF115, BF135, BF150, BF200 10.2 \nMercury 75/90/115 four stroke, 70/90/115 SeaPro, 115 ProXS \n135/150 four stroke, 135/150 SeaPro, 150 ProXS \n175/200 four stroke, 200 SeaPro, 175 ProXS 10.2 \n10.6 \n10.2 \nEvinrude E75 (DPL, DPX, DSL), E90 (DPL, DPX, DSL), E115 (DBX, DCX, DHL, DPL, DHX, DPX, DSL, \nHSL), E130 (DCX, DPL, DPX, DSL), DE150/E150 (DCX, DPX, DBX, DCX, DHL, DPL, DPX, \nDSL, HSL), E175 (DCX, DPL, DPX, DSL), DE200/E200 (2.6L – CX, PX, DCX, DPX, DSL 9.6","blaWebsiteCategories":["Mechanical Steering","Steering"],"blaWebsiteBrands":["Dometic"],"blaWebsiteProductId":58717,"productWebsiteImageUrl":"../images/bla-website-products/295060.jpg","productWebsiteImageSourceUrl":"https://bla.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/295060.jpg","productWebsiteImageDownloaded":true},{"productNumber":"295061","description":"DOMETIC XPA XTREME POWER ASSIST BRP BODY SPACER KIT","brand":"Y","variant":"PC","price":150.33,"unitCostOfSale":86.67,"categoryName":"Electrical & Electronics","topCategory":"Electrical & Electronics","subCategoryName":"Batteries, Charging & Solar","subCategory":"M - Marine Supplies","pricingCategoryUsed":"M - Marine Supplies","categoryImage":"../images/catalogue/pages/page0061.jpg","subCategoryImage